0..79 Comment "// A model built on another (#2333): `include EqInteger` in a model of a theory"
80..156 Comment "// that includes `Eq` takes `EqInteger`\'s members as the model\'s own, so the"
157..235 Comment "// model\'s reduct at `Eq` is `EqInteger` itself. `==` at the integers then has"
236..311 Comment "// two modules answering its `Eq` slot, and they are one elaboration: their"
312..381 Comment "// components convert, so the slot resolves (#739\'s uniqueness, up to"
382..397 Comment "// conversion)."
